      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393158184",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To address these problems, we propose a novel Communicative Subgraph representation learning for Multi-relational Inductive drug-Gene interactions prediction (CoSMIG), where the predictions of drug-gene relations are made through subgraph patterns, and thus are naturally inductive for unseen drugs/genes without retraining or utilizing external domain features.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:78ff66c258dafffa9a9157b9c723a4633681eaeda1e1183f35305cd630b4cd4a",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
