      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3190020173",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We introduce word-level knowledge graphs (WKGs) to store short-term and long-term knowledge.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:93ca6714d3f258d5fc8aa77a45db0168bb6f48804d90204032f193029f5a53ba",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "72f08e8a224ad2745abcb830c41347694870aa89063c14947ab8989dc7018332",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:16.321114Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:91ab915b8c2b2660459451c613e67f978cc28b4316e0d4ab54670db871167a8d#results[38];abstract[517:609]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3217011468",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent years have seen a surge in research on dynamic graph representation learning, which aims to model temporal graphs that are dynamic and evolving constantly over time.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a36c1305fa327e8289a61eec945b3274042c9260f9c73a72864cf358587cb513",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "9ec9475557942a1cc373a55dc0e0d7eec65b012da06a972d709df6dd4d5ec0d4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:55.336525Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:919bee9b1aecdbe64ddab85604f170aaf3b9bc73a2ae426ebf221143c4fe2968#results[4];abstract[0:172]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382464116",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose a family of novel Deep Hierarchical Transitive-Aligned Graph Kernels (DHTAGK) for graph classification.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a45bb869058e1a62d605e5ac616444161957224c8baa904d730c502830dc0afc",
