      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414360366",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose a dynamic deep graph convolutional network (D-DGCN) to overcome the above limitation.",
