      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382202519",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we introduce optimal graph learning to generate a cross-domain graph that effectively connects the two domains, and two domain-specific graphs to capture domain-specific structures.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b3b5a77d523ca6963145a70f4a14a390a7343726dd11a6385c2fab69619a0dc1",
