    {
      "excerpt": null,
      "id": "evidence:openalex:f6073c67bea1714e23a87f1f",
      "kind": "observed",
      "raw_sha256": "78a57b88e96fd36867ae3695563fe3eeb58cd52f699473253a383410c5e78782",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:50.627571Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:00913a2e99d1eb8f86775bfa9d4de607fc040a9f898d949df6e0f0724341fe4b#results[42]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382239594",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Learning from Demonstrations (LfD) is a powerful approach for incorporating advice from experts in the form of demonstrations.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:03cbd38649e50301e9b77bc1297375700fb89ef77ee17b886b28e4d25e12ab3d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "fc54cc9a546aa51a2f39745767a21f1ea847a56fd65f5bf1ab911bc1224f9545",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:51.959679Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:ca056cc380801ae4e989953b01bdc46e50c57a4ee499f36d2f891383504fc46c#results[37];abstract[0:126]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3035470936",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The learned policy is deployed in the target task without additional training.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1b44775424f90d550bf29da22913d44bd57ded59c2de2357a5d6007b5dc49316",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c806e469c79e7905df4c15c74e834c2a80406394b4e448e0b239c4f3c1c3acba",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:11.475408Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:0bb6b36fcf338964739ea25dd744541d04b2d3834472e57ee15878fccb147a70#results[44];abstract[273:351]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285604500",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we introduce a reinforcement learning-based (RL-based) service-rate controller that provides probabilistic upper-bounds on the end-to-end delay of the system, while preventing the overuse of service resources.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1baccc5006da9cc3e8bec1f69d21e17361b54780fc39660883bb391023ada4e4",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "8aabca571681d8c08626efe8862b44633c355350b37212bdb59f7ca7c635ef5e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:20.913838Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d38b96d4b5116eac6fe4db56eb934bd79fb6eed83f95fecf80029ee7497fd651#results[20];abstract[366:590]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3120266904",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In the last years, deep reinforcement learning (DRL) has shown its promise for designing good heuristics dedicated to solve NP-hard combinatorial optimization problems.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:2979ad78343623b118fbe4e555a6eed4d049e8192862a800154c160b6874d91c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2f462b434a45175c5e6fb0fadb1dfd5328b35f330ea6ee7c2f2292e3a0569641",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:34.509982Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:3cb839dfe8a727849da2dd24f7ead08049c06907ac0b5ddf2a494a76f6371d66#results[2];abstract[432:600]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3033044509",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we specifically focus on the online class-incremental setting where a model needs to learn new classes continually from an online data stream.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:35d5287d809fdae54f2e5748e88f209b76e678a18b74efd740950d41dcef12a2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "54a13846a12337c1bd8eef802412dabdb7db12958eb06f0c8dac19d71c7136be",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:02.158281Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:75b58b36f3790eb5b485055a694f550339a2bfb5835284bee0482c9becb1663a#results[0];abstract[420:577]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3175853876",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Despite significant recent advances in the field of Deep Reinforcement Learning (DRL), such methods typically incur high cost of training to learn effective policies, thus posing cost and safety challenges in many practical applications.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:4f42c5e7cd245a0c52e20fe1555fcd090d70f0957a0902254f39daa0670e5699",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "4b2b13b1c6a84ea932a55152702c2ec0c3b32d1e3204bed2e1133b53bb639484",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:39.944476Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:214a212e2a9f6a7c910b724d165dd2c86823ed3b724e786483b5b827fb64a3d7#results[35];abstract[0:237]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409361576",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent advances in symbolic dynamic programming (SDP) have significantly broadened the class of MDPs for which exact closed-form value functions can be derived.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:53eb270e1dcb60d2218ba208cc39a7f935713a91fd2c5873e4cdb40c985399de",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5fd550f4e64359d9f741b32a084f8e4f713b4f89b2547cdb44178926a52d4ca4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:59.339088Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:efcf852c5be8b7c4c9ec530f6d8d35ac62a5be1fd914fdcaab4dba5185ace8fd#results[41];abstract[0:160]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3187079608",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Inspired by the recent success of Multi Agent Reinforcement Learning (MARL) in solving complex control problems, we present FedMarl, a federated learning framework that relies on trained MARL agents to perform efficient run-time client selection.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:7e54b1dd6d90df8eb85249fd97a8846f2cbe7ec4113b59f049da90f57bf35b07",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "54f72b43c51c0c6d802b310f9c803298d9b7323df29e2a6268147ce37bb2df4d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:12.326022Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:a63cdf2e55cd79997526b62f201ebb3ccd7bdd7af20d48cc2149bda8f8ba9aef#results[3];abstract[607:853]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4226167551",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent advances in deep learning have enabled optimization of deep reactive policies (DRPs) for continuous MDP planning by encoding a parametric policy as a deep neural network and exploiting automatic differentiation in an end-to-end model-based gradient descent framework.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:abb76821c256058b58401b24a9f4e0a08e79d36531801daf03cdaeff145b34ee",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1a3bdb6666b0952626c0a042fdba52cdce8e3ead65976dcac09419c01e9e0f5d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:15.219017Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d5e89e7ba11f9243d770f8d0e61f89b861d2c7eb3f7a77a61fadfb359ff8d3f3#results[36];abstract[0:274]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283800411",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The shortcomings of maximum likelihood estimation in the context of model-based reinforcement learning have been highlighted by an increasing number of papers.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:acf8a998d57bffe1498b4abcbc196a0b943090586f13f5954b70d1e0286d9439",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "3a321bc169da7801776b8591ee4ce5462bd78770b82bed5435c044bd9cb6c074",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:05.876432Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6dbfd0527ef2851a7f71e7f7e0d3e76e74f15237f09b3942f519163e617f70ea#results[28];abstract[0:159]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3170371439",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent advances in efficient planning in deterministic or stochastic high-dimensional domains with continuous action spaces leverage backpropagation through a model of the environment to directly optimize action sequences.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:dd8e98828250b6d6c022c5d3cfacbb00a23e7740a13beecd8f045a3837052b64",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1a3bdb6666b0952626c0a042fdba52cdce8e3ead65976dcac09419c01e9e0f5d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:15.219017Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d5e89e7ba11f9243d770f8d0e61f89b861d2c7eb3f7a77a61fadfb359ff8d3f3#results[47];abstract[0:222]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4283789357",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
