    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Furthermore, we develop our model BERT-ERC according to the proposed paradigm, which improves ERC performance in three aspects, namely suggestive text, fine-grained classification module, and two-stage training.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:03330ae3ad7827748e6304316a2021250e6bb5174920a5a24f36195dbc383007",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "10c9e6e8c9e69506cfcde22dc45f442641d1b0e184bc5f78f53cacb3ff75b389",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:10.993792Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:a4cc449473053a79e50ca3a7e36f69f6aac5b2ad38b157facaa47abd66a920e2#results[4];abstract[633:844]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382202684",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This paper proposes a Semi-Attention Partition (SAP) method to learn well-aligned part features for occluded person re-identification (re-ID).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:034e9e092b6b525637aa466b046d9a80c6829c1883c7d1fc7ed57e3aa5bd913f",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "e6600ad8f94ef64d4621e21f76fbb67d0229ac5d946f4164f75cc72beed9471f",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:27.653183Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:967312d65e29b11404dd4ab55e6c56d8baa4e276359a63ad665ff9a1ea307969#results[13];abstract[0:142]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382467088",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Trained with the canonicalization operations and the derived regularizations, our method learns to factorize a skeleton sequence into three independent semantic subspaces, i.e., motion, structure, and view angle.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:03b942340650b2b92030149dfd93b71b999853fe7d1f27d4c6bcbd05228bb19f",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "1b3068309293e198df33e250ad1b634f034de92bb512902a6bffa7192ed1fdad",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:45.560719Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6cda1bc1a36609c08e568babbf769605f650225da44911e6714e9ab9b29364a8#results[24];abstract[588:800]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4226115602",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Therefore, directly transferring embeddings may introduce irrelevant source-domain collaborative information.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:04ac95038ef6a794d5210990252c5a43c940452550d8150c3b037e9c2fca45e5",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a96ec25ae6229f19294cca1599cf5bf95a18a5f382ef806ae39c4ca976572a29",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:01.740214Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:899fd0412a1fdebf547e24fe9ff99c0e8546b676b0d5cf24ec02a5d3e5c8acfc#results[3];abstract[437:546]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366224",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Contrastive learning at pixel-level can alleviate the dependency on annotations by learning dense representations from unlabeled data.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:06f7a1a402dff77188da53ee54ac14bc67e2ed86f32f0d230356fbace3fb33be",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "af2860decc89685ef3c0ed1a8be269b745233fef69d1402ff0ac4cd782cb086b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:38.815106Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f3971cdfd0728d5a79f32f719fd69ef3f45cecb080e511295b14f853cf618281#results[34];abstract[265:399]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4200632507",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Finally, with adaptive learnable parameters, we merge image and text prototypes to obtain the final prototypes, achieving a more powerful classifier for multi-label few-shot image classification.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:084b5558bd66947301bc3ba8da5494d1590e00f2f664b66d0b2654fe2570d0f8",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "0753eaf27e56783396510a795086f2a8973b2e25f06abb93894f62fb10ae867b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:39.724771Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6c0eb5fc775facc1f1561a1d8e506ab3fb46f097f8fd2f7164b28344ba7e7168#results[33];abstract[1337:1532]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409367145",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This work delves into a relatively unexplored facet of the task: the transferability of video moment localization models.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0af0729d320638c23974ada0371243b3a9a7eb74615f3b90b2f268390fd0f48c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ce9017386a2d7669301c2859ce1114cb2df72477d2066c8c6d5f901753b0d20b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:22.095170Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:86267671d288a39614ccab076919913c0a4e14e351c6653f8f68fbdecf92e742#results[49];abstract[228:349]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393158722",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "(iii) Presenting a self-supervised Multi-Scale Token Recycling (MSTR) Module featured by recycling discarded patch tokens in multi-scale features, further enhancing representation capability and retrieval performance.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:0cc01562fee21e430f153783b82c818f736aa0492de70050a253fdb68d7939c4",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "fcc8d244fa950248335ce17c26efe455d7834abe2a3f164d7ca74522ffec3e8e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:35.111764Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1ad9f0ddb54c712a6fedda2ddb92d76f852412ee648e8e975c55886287a13d2e#results[14];abstract[910:1127]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409368371",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Thanks to the knowledge injection, our model learns domain-invariant features for non-pivots according to their relationships with pivots.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:148b74390a9bd50ce719c10993c922e35b626136d5ef466215707e4287b2d8a9",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "72f08e8a224ad2745abcb830c41347694870aa89063c14947ab8989dc7018332",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:16.321114Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:91ab915b8c2b2660459451c613e67f978cc28b4316e0d4ab54670db871167a8d#results[21];abstract[864:1002]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3198064221",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The action grounding dynamically associates the verbs to related subjects and the corresponding context, which keeps fine-grained spatial and temporal details for action prediction.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:166aeb3fe4089af03f1dfdf7c4d365986e95f1ce98e76254301c0e555856c1f2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ce9017386a2d7669301c2859ce1114cb2df72477d2066c8c6d5f901753b0d20b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:22.095170Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:86267671d288a39614ccab076919913c0a4e14e351c6653f8f68fbdecf92e742#results[42];abstract[873:1054]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393158567",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Extensive experiments over five challenging datasets for two tasks (occluded and holistic Re-ID) demonstrate that our proposed PFD is superior promising, which performs favorably against state-of-the-art methods.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1c3bcf6d263cd46d275a129698ab039bf5b6635e2a9e8ca2af41ce3c3a6eb309",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "af2860decc89685ef3c0ed1a8be269b745233fef69d1402ff0ac4cd782cb086b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:38.815106Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f3971cdfd0728d5a79f32f719fd69ef3f45cecb080e511295b14f853cf618281#results[3];abstract[1399:1611]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4200635168",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To address this issue, we propose a Spatial-View-Temporal transformer (SVTformer) to decouple spatial-view-temporal information in sequential order for correlation learning and model dependencies between them in a local-to-global manner.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:1f94fb91f38a4aef58bb43f8b8b44e7713f3a1656cfa66b5e6437e33e4e585ce",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "52e1ad134f6ceca73396c261d26cb7d3ca6cf596ae5d67c1c4676c97513f64a5",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:56.080577Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:40aa6b86fb4e80d0619dc24f5f79dd9b5449cf9c0203b77c8af8d92d66bc3da6#results[25];abstract[439:676]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365003",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To enhance the inter-type separation and intra-type compactness, we further propose a confidential prototypical self-supervised learning module to uncover the consensus category structure of the reference and target data.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:20dcbde7f699c5acca50152d6418fa2da87c578f5127a042c51b7089873d58a1",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c3ebe60f14638122f53c96af2f52091b3284e35cfebb5b626d2a9860ebd1d954",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:44.303041Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:3719ec5e18848b92968b9494c7b8971a120e9aa670e3aaac23ea3171c2f4d202#results[29];abstract[1283:1504]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382239952",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Based on this, we propose a novel Contrastive balancing Representation learning Network using a partial distance measure, called CRNet, for estimating the heterogeneous dose-response curves without losing the continuity of treatments.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:223d7bf50dc4bdb18819d9269d36362090193e58ea04833c377d0acdd1d5c2be",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "034ab99d101c75c494ab6d977b62525d150f29fd039a2d50e94c840498038c39",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:09.933930Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:bef0c6e135f7fa0640b807035003c5d14db4dab9f7589140681bf3142ed1b02e#results[24];abstract[874:1108]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393152850",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "However, the teacher and the student are trained on the same dataset and tend to learn similar feature representations, whereas the most general knowledge should be found through differences.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:2338df59e12ab7af79f5c0d999c1db0931e71419c6bce19d02dcafc12b12bcaf",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "42a914d02381733eee64c05206ff29683efcb34537e43afd49281d1a686c0761",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:18.028499Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:5160fe6c0ee6997af9d8879f30b410b928594e0f296e250fdd46138368bf8fac#results[30];abstract[281:472]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3130859587",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Although the recurrent structure for ST-VSR adopts bidirectional propagation to aggregate information from the entire video, collecting the temporal information between the past and future via one-stage representations inevitably loses the long-range relations.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:24b736e598e05c2175c3ee03d06ed23ef6ec9d1e0f3adc2fcb2b24003ad88d33",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
