      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382318871",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Building upon the insights, we develop the Joint knowledge Editing for information Enrichment and probability Promotion (JEEP) method, which jointly edits both the low and high layers to modify the two critical recall stages.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:55b4744810a55a2e564f6c8f556d608627d9c8f054911c6cd6f8b290dc27604d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ed52e831ff440c0d35ce3824f6a9f83ba365e8b0bf8638f55f57406813ed63ae",
