      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393160074",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we revisit iterative back-translation, a simple yet effective semi-supervised method, to investigate whether and how it can improve compositional generalization.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:5aad9fb2605ae61246df171307a0c963542a1697369f0b8eb14e50be3d5a9229",
