      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3175422428",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To better incorporate non-differentiable distortions into training, we propose a novel dual-decoder architecture (END^2).",
