      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365751",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "A predictor for object-color corresponding matrix (OCCM) and a novel attention transfer module (ATM) are introduced to solve the color-object coupling problem.",
