      "source_locator": "openalex-request:80e359606b05e96e8fad17731619ae1d28ac32962b7ddcad600df6755fe6fe29#results[46];abstract[725:873]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382202780",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The self-training strategy adaptively improves the decision boundary of the model for the target domain, which implicitly facilitates the extraction of domain-invariant features.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:659807bf8e3de74d986b766e3e530ab2c5cd0c9694ac6d74bb77c5a4d5f112b3",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "d90b696c01ac9abc422fd75705e17d9b710dd07e5a489aa26a9b96e435ad5b58",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:25:08.796210Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f95cc29e6f506f77d7ae2ccf07b6ed5451c00b0116785564d10601756aadfa9c#results[13];abstract[589:767]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3173206925",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Learning user representation is a critical task for recommendation systems as it can encode user preference for personalized services.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:67884648713264509355b5818c77088b0d5174f89e1b366f84c2dac341e95d9d",
