      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4285602153",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Learning without forgetting strategy is also deployed in self-supervised adaptation by combining self-supervision and model adaptation via contrastive learning.",
