      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1006cc8a44818b4cefc731788cd38802f557ae377d547125cc57d3af8bb065b9#results[45];abstract[1003:1109]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3192681061",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In recent years, remarkable results have been achieved in self-supervised action recognition using skeleton sequences with contrastive learning.",
