      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4200634815",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Because of the insufficient vocabulary of video data, previous methods leverage the image-text pretraining model for recognizing object instances by separately aligning each frame with class texts.",
