      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409370041",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose VLM2Scene, which exploits the potential of VLMs to enhance 3D self-supervised representation learning through our proposed image-text-LiDAR contrastive learning strategy.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:967393a0cf39e3eceb6b75b66b0cbe3477aecde71239588425f6a4b08704e5d2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
