      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393148771",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "While current self-supervised learning methods have shown potential, they often consider an image as a whole thereby overlooking the extensive, complex relationships among local regions from one or multiple images.",
