      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, we first design an OT-based prototypical representation learning paradigm to encourage both global discriminations of clusters and local consistency of cells to uncover the intrinsic structure of target data.",
