      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414360166",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Network embedding aims at learning a representation vector for each node and label to preserve their proximity, while most existing methods suffer from serious underfitting when dealing with datasets with dense node-label links.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:9ec24a804c1beee71a86dc65987450f7a2a4738454c24ff8713a00595a5324fc",
