      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4280525693",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Then, we augment the labeled samples by sampling from the estimated distribution, which can provide sufficient supervision for training the classification model.",
