      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365941",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, we utilize the blind-spot network commonly used in self-supervised denoising tasks as our backbone, and perform self-supervised learning by constructing proper pseudo-labels.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a454d4badb164f143e00184cb126b26c43df37e1c0ed0f7c1f56d903d468e97f",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "6252091c118b9bb68660c27d8e6f0032eebead3e1cf6b1f74696c9dc4e005ea1",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:10.030956Z",
