      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409363484",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, identity representation is acquired from a set of samples sharing the same ID, whereas the modality of images is learned by fine-tuning the Stable Diffusion (SD) on modality-specific data.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a5b751553c33cb9a2ff09e66b0dd399719b4854774fe540df60d000092417d2e",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "43f4689046dc4c434e5c5f13bfcaa572c4f983e897a3a1384baeb52584ed6611",
