      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409365953",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, AdaMixT introduces various patches and leverages both General Pre-trained Models (GPM) and Domain-specific Models (DSM) for multi-scale feature extraction.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a5dbe6eedcebb393066300ef8c6adfdf2de97f8aca10088d546ab8b365e5f98c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "aba492f7d7d63d2f4dbbac34aa920238b2c794166e0d74f855b453feb4829f8e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:07.459650Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:1f8a49e5cca0d11028eb5a09d38b749c0cb461cf8393fa0414210f9ef6e9fdc8#results[4];abstract[551:720]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359925",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This is achieved by constructing dynamic class-wise visual prototypes as well as a semantic similarity matrix that enables the projection of visual features into the semantic space.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a78746bdd69b93bd6b6e5da6feb323722d3f17e14647b3f3a7c7c9e2ec4e71f5",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a8fd9ac1c3d78d93c9d758d9a89e87f68f15f6136e380620eb4c12c722c28515",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:31.270655Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fb56ee1d7b4705234c76cc11b575a973c2afa4a00d0200c55f36f7bbaf4161ff#results[49];abstract[762:943]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393159050",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "It first projects the event streams into spatial and temporal embeddings using StemNet, then, encodes and fuses the dual-view representations using Transformer networks.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a8eff9f72c1e8bc974336d50b32ff2ddcc7478f6e051eab7c1238e41a729c4ce",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "a8fd9ac1c3d78d93c9d758d9a89e87f68f15f6136e380620eb4c12c722c28515",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:31.270655Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:fb56ee1d7b4705234c76cc11b575a973c2afa4a00d0200c55f36f7bbaf4161ff#results[8];abstract[995:1164]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393148253",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Moreover, a novel conditional contrastive learning on hash codes is proposed to adopt self-supervised learning in multi-label scenarios.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a8fc29e5df6deb09c9ab420deb7ecd12b5758bd06e473b97d70e2806f5f970b2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "acd9ed7d7da11dad23ee64e516f05a5dc0ca8dd495471f4386a717a38f645a05",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:03.783026Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:a0ffca83d6193c00c1dded26a073da0fa10c777c4afb89663ddd44edd49e12ae#results[26];abstract[925:1061]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4280635142",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "On the server side, we propose relational supervised contrastive learning to provide more supervision signals to aid the global model updating.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a9f13e5ac84f04528c9a0ae3596aeb27a2ce8537e717c1e1c4295f8da55c44c2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "0b3874a3fa6ad51ce51fac553271db404e075ecbd1638763835e384bc8b31af1",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:43.642825Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:43bba5c488b98eb97eb4c3c383c7b94591fc778fb77d2383e8b0a42843390b85#results[2];abstract[1309:1452]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409363407",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Furthermore, we find that our proposed LION has an excellent generalization performance, making it an easy way to boost transfer learning in the future.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:ad892b0aa488c3a637e9c3714161f983715b050a92fa1a24de435aca97093438",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2c2f1b5bd689366032fc33094142d125fcf422fd89e7fa4f4f3be185959b5914",
