      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393148183",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "This insight leads us to develop a meta-learning-based framework for optimizing classifiers with this novel loss, introducing the effects of augmentation while bypassing the explicit augmentation process.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:af4f5c0be847ff3c070a0a2d190407c97034e07b60acb7e04a827a399e10d9a4",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c917e561f57eee10a43d4fde2f98cc2f7c1d8066b5eaae9afa48284c0a5ce4d9",
