      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401024689",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, Sparse Mixture-of-Adapters is designed in parallel to MLP layers in both vision and language branches, where different experts specialize in distinct aspects of person knowledge to handle features more finely.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b08de7d49fe0a5829d2fb81b6f2b86701509250153d51973c598e55164a6dec5",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "8815c7e041f21abc403df63f04cff330229e46e7cd4f509b5b0aea8b1ad1aba2",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:40.732787Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:d28f921c2cca0500fefbd59cc788a272466f0e1d839cba716932ee769a56d2fc#results[0];abstract[745:968]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409367909",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Due to the insufficiency of electronic health records (EHR) data utilized in practical diagnosis prediction scenarios, most works are devoted to learning powerful patient representations either from structured EHR data (e.g., temporal medical events, lab test results, etc.) or unstructured data (e.g., clinical notes, etc.).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b261018063d5892bc2ed6fb5a63ebabce12a389b4256884ddff90192c7de6118",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "70dd4f4d794b7d91b232ef5ce1ae2a9f3eb63af3270591182411bf6b9b492ad2",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:33.516669Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:4b9881d1025fec17c944ae7e9e82ae2d24ba1c9b116a7c8eb80b66b18557ae79#results[3];abstract[0:325]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4385768065",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To this end, we propose TransTailor, targeting at pruning the pre-trained model for improved transfer learning.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b78434e5ea75e17ccd82d79cedfc79da2e8a8e4812ae4a49bf9c2caa442f40e7",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "24b6e032ea3fde9a71dbf3042c0600e1b44a42e91a404001b40bf44afeb4a65c",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:57.803701Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:b18fd6478584a9b842cda2072101848fc23a2188e31ed1eaef6e5f3c06f90ac8#results[10];abstract[503:614]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3177071754",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Leveraging contrastive learning, CMAA is designed to learn features that are robust to large-scale and hybrid attacks while maintaining the discrimination of those features.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:b87cb29a59c9be58671db13b813a522c4d696cdd34996bb5c8527c158edb803d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2e95fd9c9d51f982c394399e68aeb10d87d00ba60b699de04debb9802b28ffb0",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:28:51.090739Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:07c51861e3646b310ee2ce71a131691b4634eb136e6ea69a58999e9def926f46#results[47];abstract[373:546]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409366018",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "(1) It proposes a one-class learning based technique for CL, which considers features of each class holistically and represents a new approach to solving the CL problem.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:bb283a2c5b7ae02aa22212b078b6bdd67ad7fa888d78d0a55af62d41eb3574d0",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ac2ed57201651f090afbda17cbc1c6b64205bf188fb727a7dee8af20a103796e",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:53.775200Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:f871bb5a39d904991fdf4940a2a1917d4c021451fb28c8d8c782799360ba1527#results[8];abstract[842:1011]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3174101157",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We observe that trend information inherent in keyframe annotations could act as extra supervision and raising the awareness of AU-specific facial appearance changing trends during training is the key to learning invariant AU-specific features.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:be2403828c2b7049541fb8c301cfb18e3cb38ab07e7e98d350d28df5e7d7e2e9",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ac4b9c0cb20ff9ca6ecdae23414e1202f15b43fc9149f7954046ef473fceaf46",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:15.864159Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:18cc4ca5e75597b06ebff8397227c9fa11931e573f27fbe1c6c354aeb6947e41#results[42];abstract[455:698]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393158523",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The two key ideas are a multi-frame fusion for temporal coherence and an instance-aware style transfer.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:bef4f648168a0b3e8c57630b1addefabb6fe8ef0abb98d5dc185d307ace23eb7",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "c3200b2f58f42e4a1dea5dfdf9b361608992c011ec7ad2b155981b07f71b5f6b",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:44.933965Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:01c5059546762c3da721da5af276fce8cf7d8c5a7378467ccbce1634623ca92d#results[48];abstract[473:576]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3190175669",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Unlike existing methods, TS2Vec performs contrastive learning in a hierarchical way over augmented context views, which enables a robust contextual representation for each timestamp.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:c16e09ad64e4709b693dcb37e64bff5b0b3849c35e3b9acd176340ea1b32ae0d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
