      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4385767446",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Specifically, we introduce an exemplar-free LReID method called Distribution Rehearsing via Adaptive Style Kernel Learning (DASK).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:c23de8657cb987793ed71daf8238d5536555e803e1f0762062d547a09eb4da23",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "2e95fd9c9d51f982c394399e68aeb10d87d00ba60b699de04debb9802b28ffb0",
