      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409367237",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "The final equivalent receptive field is accordingly enlarged, which is capable of capturing both short- and long-range dependencies in spatial and temporal domains.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:d594b9a549b02486eac28dfe1a8b96acfdbc0ade02e832baed067b925edf91cc",
