      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4385764558",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Existing self-supervised representation learning combined with classical k-means clustering achieved unsupervised image segmentation, but it was constrained by time-consuming test-time pixel-wise feature extraction and clustering synchronization.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:dca0bab787140e1b193fac777fc24b89ae1befab547c6d2e9b473ac30929a575",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
