      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:35.622352Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6155b447cdeb60fd0b02dbe843f3c71503969b4a47b98c7b0943de30288fe54c#results[34];abstract[1290:1500]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409362370",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Moreover, we devise a graph self-supervised regularization, which helps automatically assimilate the collective synergy of stocks and improve the generalization ability of overall model.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:fb31d99872c26134de43d78ad1a63f3d5f763f177ffb546714a63accdaed64b2",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "73e2bf063462b221f4db074f96331ce94e8eefcac2c5976447178a194698d55a",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:14.938295Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:06287f797167047175047a5aba3c73a10770abcd83d647efce69b2e9dc0a6022#results[4];abstract[1046:1232]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4224996103",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Finally, integrating visual and textual prototypes based on fine-grained feature mining into the model improves the recognition performance of all classes in FSCIL.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:fc69a0ce2fa6aedd9a2f5d88300f6b56d5bb43ef95f0de02db49066ec07528f8",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "e672f732eac0da59019f4d26ff0c1fbe4ebfb278f448e94268a046597fe31953",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:38.350378Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:8708d2756b2a8ad0657fc33cc839e06d618f78a400639d594096694476ff74d8#results[19];abstract[1280:1444]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4401023916",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
